[14] On XXXX XXXX, 2014, Mr. Justice Harrington heard the appeal of the claimants. On XXXX XXXX, 2014, he issued written reasons. The application for judicial review was granted and the decision of the RPD was quashed. The matter was referred back to another member of the RPD for redetermination. The Federal Court did not agree with the negative credibility findings and the lack of analysis of state protection. Essentially, the findings were of "procedural unfairness".
